        "seat": "fable51-low-A",
        "stage": "spells",
        "content": "{\"analysis\":\"Black-Red deck built around three copies of Ozai, the Phoenix King plus red burn and black removal. Red is clearly deepest (Lightning Strike, Iroh's Demonstration, Firebending Lesson, Bumi Bash, Combustion Man, Mongoose Lizards, Jeong Jeong, Boar-q-pine, Deserter's Disciples, Cunning Maneuver), and black adds Epic Downfall, Azula x2, Dai Li Indoctrination, Callous Inspector, and the hybrid Pretending Poxbearers. Barrels of Blasting Jelly helps fix and doubles as removal. Left out: all white cards (Iroh Tea Master, Razor Rings, Kyoshi Warriors, Glider Kids, Curious Farm Animals), green/white hybrids, blue flyers, and Rumble Arena/dual lands (lands are added separately; Boiling Rock Prison could be swapped in for basics). 23 spells, 17 lands (roughly 9 Mountain / 8 Swamp).\",\"decision\":\"accept\",\"chosen_spells\":[\"Ozai, the Phoenix King\",\"Ozai, the Phoenix King\",\"Ozai, the Phoenix King\",\"Lightning Strike\",\"Iroh's Demonstration\",\"Firebending Lesson\",\"Bumi Bash\",\"Epic Downfall\",\"Combustion Man\",\"Azula, On the Hunt\",\"Azula, On the Hunt\",\"Jeong Jeong, the Deserter\",\"Mongoose Lizard\",\"Mongoose Lizard\",\"Boar-q-pine\",\"Deserter's Disciple\",\"Deserter's Disciple\",\"Pretending Poxbearers\",\"Pretending Poxbearers\",\"Callous Inspector\",\"Dai Li Indoctrination\",\"Cunning Maneuver\",\"Barrels of Blasting Jelly\"]}",
